OL,3,GNEWSAFirst female boss for 227-year-old
OL,4,Abrewer
OL,5,
OL,6,FSuffolk brewer Greene King has named
OL,7,Fits first female chief executive in its
OL,8,Fmore than 200-year history.
OL,10,FClair Preston-Beer, who has been with
OL,11,Fthe Bury St Edmunds-based business
OL,12,Fsince 2020, will succeed Nick
OL,13,FMackenzie, who will step down at the
OL,14,Fend of next February after nearly eight
OL,15,Fyears in charge.
OL,17,FPreston-Beer joined as managing
OL,18,Fdirector of pubs before being appointed
OL,19,Fchief operating officer in 2024 and
OL,20,Fchief digital and commercial officer
OL,21,Fthis year.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,380,370,200,160,0,100
